---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "AOC | Alex Orlando Counselling, Calgary";
const description = "A thoughtful space for mental health, substance use, and meaningful change. Explore Alex Orlando Counselling in Calgary, Alberta.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} bodyClass="home">
<main id="main" tabindex="-1"><div class="wrap"><section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow">Calgary, Alberta · Alex Orlando Counselling</div><h1><span class="hero-title">Space to<br>be heard.</span><em>Room to change.</em></h1><p>A thoughtful, human approach to mental health, substance use, and the changes that matter to you.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="mailto:alex@alexorlando.com?subject=Consultation%20Request&amp;body=Hi%20Alex%2C%0A%0AI%27d%20like%20to%20request%20a%20consultation.%20Could%20you%20please%20let%20me%20know%20your%20availability%3F%0A%0AThank%20you.">Book a Consultation <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/services/">Explore counselling</a></div><div class="hero-note">Your story. Your pace. A way forward.</div></div><a class="hero-photo" href="/about/" aria-label="Meet Alex Orlando"><span class="portrait-index" aria-hidden="true">01</span><img src="/alex-orlando-portrait.jpg" alt="Alex Orlando" width="1536" height="1024" fetchpriority="high"><span class="portrait-caption"><span>Meet Alex Orlando</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a></section><div class="intro-strip"><span>Mental health & wellbeing</span><span>Addictions & substance use</span><span>Understanding through education</span></div></div><section class="section begin"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">A place to begin</div><h2>You don’t need to have it all figured out.</h2></div><p>Sometimes the first step is making space for what has been difficult to put into words.</p></div><div class="cards"><a class="card" href="/addictions/"><span class="number">01 / SUBSTANCE USE</span><h3>A different relationship<br>with substance use.</h3><p>Explore patterns, understand what use means in your life, and consider what you want to change.</p><span class="text-link">Addictions & substance use ↗</span></a><a class="card" href="/mental-health/"><span class="number">02 / MENTAL HEALTH</span><h3>Support for what<br>you’re carrying.</h3><p>Space to talk about emotional distress, relationships, life transitions, and feeling stuck.</p><span class="text-link">Mental health & wellbeing ↗</span></a><a class="card" href="/resources/"><span class="number">03 / LEARN & REFLECT</span><h3>Understanding can be<br>a starting point.</h3><p>Clear, grounded resources to help you ask questions and make sense of mental health and addiction.</p><span class="text-link">Explore the resource library ↗</span></a></div></div></section><section class="section tint"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">The person behind AOC</div><h2>Meet Alex Orlando.</h2><p>AOC brings together two connected interests: counselling that makes room for the individual, and education that makes complex ideas easier to understand.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">More about Alex ↗</a></div><div><p class="quote">Understanding starts<br>with curiosity.</p><p style="margin-top:28px">A place to explore your experiences in context, consider what matters to you, and find language for the changes you want to make.</p><a class="text-link" href="/approach/">Explore the approach ↗</a></div></div></section><section class="section learning"><div class="wrap"><figure class="landscape"><img src="/nature.jpg" alt="Still blue water at Lake Louise reflecting evergreen slopes and sunlit mountain peaks" loading="lazy"><figcaption>A little perspective. A little room to breathe.</figcaption></figure><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">The learning space</div><h2>Clear ideas.<br>Useful perspectives.</h2></div><div><p>Browse mental health information, substance use resources, and educational videos from established Canadian organizations.</p><a class="text-link" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:22px" href="/resources/">Visit resources & videos ↗</a></div></div></div></section></main>
</Layout>
